   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Plural prepositional",
     "texto": [
      "In all genders, the plural prepositional is formed from the nominative plural. After a hard stem **-ах** is used; after a soft stem, **-ях**: **школы → в школах**, **книги → о книгах**, **друзья → о друзьях**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Plural adjectives",
     "texto": [
      "The adjective agrees with the noun in number and case, but it has its own ending. In the plural prepositional, **-ых** is used as the basic form and **-их** after a soft consonant or the consonants of the spelling rule (**г, к, х, ж, ч, ш, щ**): **новый → новых**, **большой → больших**, **хороший → хороших**. The noun keeps its plural ending **-ах/-ях**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
